# ABC Company Employee Data Analysis

## Project Overview
This project analyzes the ABC Company employee dataset using Python. The dataset contains employee information such as Team, Position, Age, Height, Salary, and other details. The project includes data preprocessing, analysis, and graphical visualization.

## Preprocessing
- Loaded the dataset using Pandas.
- Replaced the values in the Height column with random values between 150 and 180.
- Verified the dataset before performing analysis.

## Analysis Performed
1. Distribution of employees across each team.
2. Percentage of employees in each team.
3. Distribution of employees based on position.
4. Predominant age group.
5. Team with the highest salary expenditure.
6. Position with the highest salary expenditure.
7. Correlation between Age and Salary.

## Graphical Representations
- Bar chart for team distribution.
- Bar chart for position distribution.
- Bar chart for age group distribution.
- Bar charts for salary expenditure by team and position.
- Scatter plot showing the relationship between Age and Salary.

## Insights
- Employee distribution varies across different teams.
- Some positions have more employees than others.
- One age group has the highest number of employees.
- Salary expenditure differs significantly between teams and positions.
- The Age vs Salary scatter plot helps identify the correlation between age and salary.

